# Milestone 12: headings and paragraphs (reference/components/heading.md). Pages of 595 × 300 with
# margins of 40: page area of 515 × 220 from (40, 40), which ends at y = 260.
#
# The style of each element type comes from Styles. Lines of 1.2 × Size: 24 (Heading 1), 16.8
# (Heading 2), 14.4 (Heading 3) and 12 (Paragraph).
# h1: two Text, 48 high. The margins between siblings merge (the larger one).
# h2b would fit at the end of page 1, but p2 would not: the engine avoids the break after a
# heading, so h2b moves to page 2 with p2. Its top margin is truncated at the break.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 595
		Height: 300
		Margin: 40
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: Heading 1
			Typography:
				Size: 20
				Bold: true
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 10 0
		For element: Heading 2
			Typography:
				Size: 14
				Bold: true
			Box:
				Margin: 6 0 4 0
		For element: Heading 3
			Typography:
				Size: 12
				Italic: true
		For element: Paragraph
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 6 0
	Section:
		Heading 1:
			Id: h1
			Text: Resultados
			Text: del trimestre
		Paragraph:
			Id: p1
			Content >>
				Primer párrafo.
		Heading 2:
			Id: h2a
			Text: Ventas
		Heading 3:
			Id: h3
			Text: Detalle
		Block:
			Id: fill
			Box:
				Height: 80
				Background: #F1EFE8
		Heading 2:
			Id: h2b
			Text: Costes
		Paragraph: Segundo párrafo.
			Id: p2
